# BlockStudio

Follow [docs/blockstudio-blocks.md](docs/blockstudio-blocks.md) and [docs/blockstudio-fields-and-extensions.md](docs/blockstudio-fields-and-extensions.md).

`block.json` is the source of truth. Share one CSS file between the editor and Astro. `set` classes are not in `innerHTML`. Copy extension values from `attrs.blockstudio.attributes` (the normalizer already flattens them) and apply the class in the Astro component. Run `pnpm generate` after a field change.
